        strategy: {
          basic: 'Keep track of which Chariots and Cannons have been played. Because there are only 32 pieces, counting is highly effective.',
          intermediate: "Pair Management: If you have a Marshal (Red 2) and General (Black 2), they are unbeatable as a pair. Save them for a large 'sweep' of high-value pawns.",
          advanced: "The 'Hidden Lead': Lead with a low-value Red Soldier to draw out high-value Black Pawns when you suspect an opponent has a weak hand, then use your mid-tier pieces to win later tricks.",
